  "description": "***KakaoPage x Kenaz Hahaha Webtoon Academy Debut Class, 2nd Cohort Selected Work***\n\nHan-Gyeol used to work as the youngest barista at the famous café “Atelier.” For certain reasons, she quit her job in the coffee industry and spent the next three years bouncing from one job to another. Then one day, after getting fired from her latest job, she found herself—without even realizing it—at none other than that very café where she’d been stabbed in the back?! But the café was nowhere to be found…\n\nAll that remained was a semi-basement storage room. And a bunch of strangers. They want me to run the business with them here?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
